07be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Oxide 开源 Voxel，用软件模拟完整的 Oxide 机架实验室","summary":"Oxide 介绍了 Virtual OXidE Labs（Voxel），这是一个基于 illumos 和 Rust 构建的完整软件仿真栈，可在单台主机上运行包含 sled、交换机、控制平面和微控制器的虚拟 Oxide 机架。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://oxide.computer/blog/voxel-labs","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T18:21:14.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"rfinlestno7ufbwmhy0k8vb8z"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"ZXC 0.15.0 发布：面向高速解码的无损压缩库","summary":"ZXC 0.15.0 是一个用 C17 编写、采用 BSD 3-Clause License 的无损压缩库，面向固件镜像、游戏资源和应用包等压缩一次、读取多次的场景。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://libzxc.org/","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T14:36:51.412Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"i46sxivuglgfspt7tq8sz03hv"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"LittleJS 推出重大更新，新增 3D 渲染、关卡编辑器与 AI 工具","summary":"LittleJS 推出迄今最大更新，在保留轻量、快速、无依赖 HTML5 游戏引擎特性的同时，加入可与 2D 游戏共享画布的完整 3D 渲染器。更新还包括内置 2D 和 3D 关卡编辑器、粒子效果库、性能优化，以及面向 AI 编程工具的模板和辅助模块；作者在一台机器的两种测试场景中比较了六款引擎，LittleJS 达到其他引擎最快路径的水平，并在部分测试中更快。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://frankforce.com/littlejs-is-2d-and-3d-now/","publishedAt":"2026-10-13T01:50:17.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"sd3wui90fe1jtw6ii3fa5dgj6"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Go 1.27 改进 HTTP/1 连接复用，自动异步排空未读响应体","summary":"Go 1.27 的 net/http.Transport 会自动异步排空未读的 HTTP/1 响应体，最多处理 256 KB 或等待 50 ms，以改善连接复用。文章以 Go 1.26 和 Go 1.27 的对比示例说明，未读响应体此前可能导致连接被放弃并重复建立连接；HTTP/2 不受这一问题影响。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://go.dev/blog/http-connection-reuse","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T17:42:56.542Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"w59dnrct2hivirisawk1vcm0p"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":6,"sourcesCount":4,"firstPartyEvents":2},"readingMinutes":2,"prev":"2026-10-14","next":"2026-10-16"}